\begin{proof}
令$d=\inf_{u\in M}\lVert f-u\rVert$，取$u_n\in M$使$\lVert f-u_n\rVert\to d$。

\begin{definition}[正交归一序列与完备正交系]
\label{def:functional-complete-orthonormal-system}
